        Before making any decision that affects your insurance license, carrier appointments, client relationships, 
        or regulatory compliance, consult a qualified attorney, accountant, compliance professional, or your state 
        Department of Insurance.
      </p>

      <h2>Tool comparisons are independent</h2>
      <p>
        Tool comparisons and recommendations are based on publicly available documentation, vendor materials, and 
        aggregated user reviews. We do not accept payment for placement unless clearly disclosed on the relevant page. 
        Any future affiliate relationships or sponsored content will be labeled explicitly.
      </p>

      <h2>No guarantee of accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        We make reasonable efforts to keep information accurate and up to date, including pricing, features, and 
        regulatory references. However, vendor pricing and state regulations change frequently. We do not guarantee 
        that any information on this site is complete, accurate, or current at the time you read it.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links and advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site may display advertisements through Google AdSense and may include links to third-party websites. 
        We are not responsible for the content, products, services, or privacy practices of any third-party site or 
        advertiser. Clicking an ad or affiliate link does not increase the cost to you, but we may receive compensation 
        in some cases.
      </p>

